                <li className="relative pl-6 p-2 rounded hover:border-l-4 hover:border-red-500 transition-all duration-200"><span className="absolute left-2 top-2 text-red-600 font-bold text-base">•</span>Shomoita Jahid Mitin, Rodrigue Rizk, Maximilian Scherer, Thomas Koeglsperger, Daniel Lench, KC Santosh, Arun Singh: <span className="text-gray-800">Bi-cephalic self-attended model to classify Parkinson's disease patients with freezing of gait</span>, <strong className="text-blue-700">European Journal of Neuroscience</strong> <span className="text-green-700">(2025, minor revision)</span>. <a href="https://arxiv.org/abs/2507.20862" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" className="bg-blue-100 text-blue-700 px-1 py-0.5 rounded text-xs underline">arXiv</a></li>
